      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "菲勒加斯",
      "text": "有什麼事，出去說。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "活塞",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "活塞",
      "text": "他們......算了，讓他們歇著吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "菲勒加斯",
      "text": "安置區怎麼樣了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "活塞",
      "text": "沒什麼問題，領主的人都到了，他們已經轉移了第一批輕症傷患。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "菲勒加斯",
      "text": "順利就好。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "活塞",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "活塞",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "菲勒加斯",
      "text": "有什麼想說的就直接說，別吞吞吐吐的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "活塞",
      "text": "沒什麼......只是覺得......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "菲勒加斯",
      "text": "想辭職了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "活塞",
      "text": "沒，只是對羅德島的這份工作加深了一點認識......大概吧，一點點。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "菲勒加斯",
      "text": "哈哈哈......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "菲勒加斯",
      "text": "有幹勁是好事啊，既然你還有幹勁，那現在就去清點一下醫療物資的消耗情況。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "菲勒加斯",
      "text": "做兩份記錄，一份給辦事處留檔，一份明早遞交給本地政府。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "活塞",
      "text": "......好，我這就去。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "四天後"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "菲勒加斯",
      "text": "東西都收拾好了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蘇蘇洛",
      "text": "嗯，沒問題。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "活塞",
      "text": "來了來了來了，差一點沒趕上！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "菲勒加斯",
      "text": "你幹什麼去了！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "活塞",
      "text": "啊，這不是蘇蘇洛小姐讓我幫忙買東西嗎，我都買來了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "醫療幹員",
      "text": "這麼多？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蘇蘇洛",
      "text": "咳......這些是給凱爾希醫生的書，這個是給嘉維爾醫生的工藝品。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "醫療幹員",
      "text": "這是什麼，零食？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蘇蘇洛",
      "text": "那個是給博士的......小禮物。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "活塞",
      "text": "博士？就是......那個博士？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "菲勒加斯",
      "text": "總之，替我向凱爾希醫生和博士問好。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蘇蘇洛",
      "text": "好的，沒問題。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "菲勒加斯",
      "text": "最後祝你們一路順風，安全抵達。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蘇蘇洛",
      "text": "謝謝您，我們下次再見。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "活塞",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "活塞",
      "text": "他們走了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "菲勒加斯",
      "text": "好了，回去幹活吧，還有一大堆報告要寫。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "活塞",
      "text": "......嗯......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "菲勒加斯",
      "text": "怎麼了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "活塞",
      "text": "我是不是也該找個工作機會去羅德島本艦看看呢......感覺都是些很奇妙的人。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "菲勒加斯",
      "text": "行啊，但是，先把自己手上的事情幹完再琢磨吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ]
}
